crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=486743063567892262f5e2e1030137e7", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b0f0ed45/uploads/origins/a1641fe8-8eb4-4f25-8233-af4ce10768a7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=486743063567892262f5e2e1030137e7, https://si.imgix.net/b0f0ed45/uploads/origins/a1641fe8-8eb4-4f25-8233-af4ce10768a7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=52f88e9e7540aab8bbd9209179ccace3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b0f0ed45/uploads/origins/a1641fe8-8eb4-4f25-8233-af4ce10768a7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3e9725d7fa40d4f1937b5f83cb574468 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I really admire the way you draw older men and would be honoured if you could draw my OC from my vampire setting:\n\nPetrov | 61yr\nParanoid, fatherly and dignified, he's a retired vampire slayer that used to work for the Vatican as part of their exclusive supernatural military but now travels the world with his adopted human daughter. \nHe lost his own family to vampires and his loss fuelled his sense of duty, until he was dismissed due to his health and worsening dementia. He wandered around until he met a runaway teenage girl and taught her survival skills against vampires and took care of her, while she grew to trust him as her friend/father.\nThough initially a relationship for utilitarian purposes, they became their own family who do their best to look after eachother despite all that they've lost. \nDetails: Russian and has a bad leg\n\nI have some pictures from pinterest to take inspiration from, but please draw whatever is most comfortable. Thank you for your consideration 🙏\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1TTmiUdwEHiwIfUrxBlYBDA-vVu_iW6Xh", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@worst_kitty_207/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3924920, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b3dbe081/uploads/origins/3e5069ef-0543-439a-8686-c385e4b86aed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e5aaccbd0fe829916b5ec3ef0fe4ac3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b3dbe081/uploads/origins/3e5069ef-0543-439a-8686-c385e4b86aed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e5aaccbd0fe829916b5ec3ef0fe4ac3, https://si.imgix.net/b3dbe081/uploads/origins/3e5069ef-0543-439a-8686-c385e4b86aed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2a46fdcb116cb5ffd6963a0940545a5e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b3dbe081/uploads/origins/3e5069ef-0543-439a-8686-c385e4b86aed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef0fc737b008ee078499de7a9b8bdd17 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b3dbe081/uploads/origins/3e5069ef-0543-439a-8686-c385e4b86aed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0075d29f8599ee9babee31a992939461", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b3dbe081/uploads/origins/3e5069ef-0543-439a-8686-c385e4b86aed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0075d29f8599ee9babee31a992939461, https://si.imgix.net/b3dbe081/uploads/origins/3e5069ef-0543-439a-8686-c385e4b86aed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8533f4da8d2d370045c15ce3eb7d589f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b3dbe081/uploads/origins/3e5069ef-0543-439a-8686-c385e4b86aed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bce3124c74a5fc4479e652fb67c8cbd2 3x"}, "body": "Please draw my OC?\nAn older soldier, late 40's to 50's in age, healthy in body but beginning to show his age.\nPlease do as you wish.\nA casual scene? Combat? A moment off-duty? Maintenance, patrolling, rest, engaged in hobbies, post-action recovery, anything.\nHair can be as neat or as messy as the situation wants. He tries to keep his hair neat, but sometimes fails. Hair tend to be messier as the day wears on.\nAny combination of outfit items that you wish, as the situation demands.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1D7-ZRSejcyCHLr-rsMH5SeF-96xOdlfy", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@worst_kitty_207/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3924920, "client_id": 3701848, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3e4bd894/uploads/origins/604510fb-ea0f-4803-abdc-cb7eada9b9b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=26624a10edffdd4f43ae993cd315cf8b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3e4bd894/uploads/origins/604510fb-ea0f-4803-abdc-cb7eada9b9b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=26624a10edffdd4f43ae993cd315cf8b, https://si.imgix.net/3e4bd894/uploads/origins/604510fb-ea0f-4803-abdc-cb7eada9b9b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef1423892269ddbd7cae77ad757787fc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3e4bd894/uploads/origins/604510fb-ea0f-4803-abdc-cb7eada9b9b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=da2b29f14ecd2397e38e87b3a15de2ac 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3e4bd894/uploads/origins/604510fb-ea0f-4803-abdc-cb7eada9b9b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=038130c9039d71e5b89302688e47d210", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3e4bd894/uploads/origins/604510fb-ea0f-4803-abdc-cb7eada9b9b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=038130c9039d71e5b89302688e47d210, https://si.imgix.net/3e4bd894/uploads/origins/604510fb-ea0f-4803-abdc-cb7eada9b9b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c5bb0766ac173fb1db8356585244037e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3e4bd894/uploads/origins/604510fb-ea0f-4803-abdc-cb7eada9b9b4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e7b3f0a4e4fcb9870b844d3622f026de 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I really enjoy your artwork and wanted to share a request.\n\nI'd love to see a scene featuring Yahari and Mahiro after a late-night . As they're walking home together, they're both a little tipsy from the drinks they had earlier, making them much more affectionate and uninhibited than usual. Yahari takes the lead playful, confident, and openly flirtatious while Mahiro, despite being taller, gets flustered easily and quietly goes along with the attention.\n\nWhether they're sitting on a park bench, waiting for the last train, or wandering under the city lights is completely up to you. I'd be excited to see your interpretation of the setting and how their personalities play off each other. \nNote:Mahiro has ruby red eyes \nThank you for considering my request!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1dLsCK-jgfQ6XxlXZ6Qrt4v5eA0a-aX31", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@worst_kitty_207/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3924920, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/41bc1847/uploads/origins/92fd7724-34bf-4d2f-9eb7-e90771ec7f07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1ae0c81ef39a6b6134befbe2e579b0e4", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/41bc1847/uploads/origins/92fd7724-34bf-4d2f-9eb7-e90771ec7f07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1ae0c81ef39a6b6134befbe2e579b0e4, https://si.imgix.net/41bc1847/uploads/origins/92fd7724-3