s in his prime, around 35 years old.\nPlease depict him as a “muscular, attractive older man” type of character.\n\n\n◆⒊ If the character’s left arm is exposed, please include a tattoo on his left arm shaped like a map of Afghanistan.\nFor the specific tattoo design, please refer to [4—Left Arm Tattoo] in the “Reference Materials.”\n\n\nIntended Use:\nPersonal viewing\nPersonal use, such as social media icons, headers, or computer wallpapers\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1cKs3UbyDzDWNG66V_fnKMeYF8bgoiiyb/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 49, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@worst_kitty_207/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/80d6e263/uploads/origins/a90c584c-979e-4484-8ebe-72c5217e42f7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=814645d65049e41493da8c520eb0934f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/80d6e263/uploads/origins/a90c584c-979e-4484-8ebe-72c5217e42f7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=814645d65049e41493da8c520eb0934f, https://si.imgix.net/80d6e263/uploads/origins/a90c584c-979e-4484-8ebe-72c5217e42f7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1f609032919dc50ae097aecbab0629e3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/80d6e263/uploads/origins/a90c584c-979e-4484-8ebe-72c5217e42f7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=45b0530f29b240731d66843e362a6df2 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "comic", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3924920, "nc": 32}, {"path": "/@worst_kitty_207/works/6", "private_