r a hat, glasses, goggles, or a scarf. Similarly, there is no need to draw complex tactical gear.\n\n\n\n② If the character’s left arm is exposed, please include a tattoo on his left arm shaped like a map of Afghanistan.\nFor the specific tattoo design, please refer to [4-Left Arm Tattoo] in the “Reference Materials.”\n\n\n③ If you would like to know more about the character’s personality, he is intelligent, wise, a good listener, and reserved in his emotions.\n\nhttps://mattsko.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/1-wet-shirt-471645.jpg", "nc": 49, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@worst_kitty_207/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3924920, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8534e088/uploads/origins/6662a74c-ada2-4612-851f-a3257bee025d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f249a987b118f1892beebcc0f9f4c144", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8534e088/uploads/origins/6662a74c-ada2-4612-851f-a3257bee025d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f249a987b118f1892beebcc0f9f4c144, https://si.imgix.net/8534e088/uploads/origins/6662a74c-ada2-4612-851f-a3257bee025d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=de656921e448775bf459899b058b9708 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8534e088/uploads/origins/6662a74c-ada2-4612-851f-a3257bee025d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=283d8bc063dbdd8c03e8e8abdeb242d2 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/8534e088/uploads/origins/6662a74c-ada2-4612-851f-a3257bee025d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a8b0523a7708e526e170c9ef4ed31aad", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8534e088/uploads/origins/6662a74c-ada2-4612-851f-a3257bee025d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a8b0523a7708e526e170c9ef4ed31aad, https://si.imgix.net/8534e088/uploads/origins/6662a74c-ada2-4612-851f-a3257bee025d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=adcacb147d36576ba06543865a89bd73 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8534e088/uploads/origins/6662a74c-ada2-4612-851f-a3257bee025d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ce313611273fbc6b3314640e0fe24235 3x"}, "body": "Hello, AN-sensei.\nI’ve been following your wonderful illustrations on X for a while now. I really love your Poolverine illustrations.\nIf you’re willing to take on this commission, I’d be truly grateful.\n\n······\n★ Please draw a scene where [Character 1] hugs [Character 2] from behind and kisses them. The two are in an intimate, romantic relationship.\n[Character 1] is wearing a white T-shirt, and [Character 2] is wearing a black T-shirt.\n★The NSFW setting is intended to expand creative possibilities; it does not necessarily require erotic content.\n······\n\nCharacter 1 (Maverick) reference:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1R9kuaX5LO0_XfCyg7O_AprgIYfnf0chM\n\nCharacter 2 (Thermite) reference:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1SAKQ1ZBzru35FHLfy2aETQpyLLTRALqr\n\n\n1. Neither character is wearing hats, glasses, goggles, scarves, etc.\nSimilarly, there is no need to draw complex tactical gear.\n\n\n◆2. [Character 2]’s hand is bandaged.\nCharacter 2 has a burn on their arm, so please be careful when drawing that area.\n\nIf Character 1’s left arm is exposed, please include a tattoo on the left arm that resembles the shape of a map of Afghanistan.\nFor the specific tattoo design, please refer to [4-Left Arm Tattoo] in the “Reference Materials.”\n\n\n3. Character 1: Blonde hair. Blue eyes. Has a beard.\nCharacter 2: Black hair. Blue eyes. Has a beard.\nBoth characters are middle-aged, around 35 years old.\nNote that Character 1 is slightly taller.\n\n\n\n4. If you would like to know more about the characters’ personalities:\nCharacter 1: Intellectual and wise, a good listener who keeps his emotions to himself while pursuing freedom.\nCharacter 2: Kind, loyal, and patient.\nThe two are comrades-in-arms.\n\n\nIntended Use: Personal viewing, computer desktop wallpaper, and other personal uses\n\n\n\nI apologize for the complexity of my request. Please bear with me.\nThank you for your consideration.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1R9kuaX5LO0_XfCyg7O_AprgIYfnf0chM", "nc": 161, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@worst_kitty_207/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3924920, "client_id": 3476573, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1cfd9c6d/uploads/origins/58eea66e-8956-4ac6-9c97-f9461cdc7605?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=94bc4a88aedafda6c0e2d0397d7d9df7", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1cfd9c6d/uploads/origins/58eea66e-8956-4ac6-9c97-f9461cdc7605?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=94bc4a88aedafda6c0e2d0397d7d9df7, https://si.imgix.net/1cfd9c6d/uploads/origins/58eea66e-8956-4ac6-9c97-f9461cdc7605?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=170e9abf32ad373d48c51274eea916d0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1cfd9c6d/uploads/origins/58eea66e-8956-4ac6-9c97-f9461cdc7605?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a88ed04819963e514bf74f0aa699cec9 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1cfd9c6d/uploads/origins/58eea66e-8956-4ac6-9c97-f9461cdc7605?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=88d8b44c9479307af9d15052b77b67a1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1cfd9c6d/uploads/origins/58eea66e-8956-4ac6-9c97-f9461cdc7605?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=88d8b44c9479307af9d15052b77b67a1, https://si.imgix.net/1cfd9c6d/uploads/origins/58eea66e-8956-4ac6-9c97-f9461cdc7605?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1244a7e08e36a8ca9e859bd85557616e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1cfd9c6d/uploads/origins/58eea66e-8956-4ac6-9c97-f9461cdc7605?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=824938b8c096de1c6df2bb19d826859c 3x"}, "body": "Hello! I would like you to draw my old man OC, Wulf!\n\nWulf | 56 | 170cm\nHe lives in a world with supernatural beings called \"Sin\". He used to be a mercenary, and he met his husband, who was also a mercenary. They retired and married each other. Wulf became a bartender. His husband died from alcohol poisoning, which made Wulf very guilty. He was in so much pain that he manifested supernatural powers. He can create a palace in his mind, which looks like a bar. He also started to hallucinate his dead husband. \n\nMotif: alcohol, warm light, mahogany, sniper rifle, explosion\n\nYou can draw him in a serious setting or a sexy setting, I love both!\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/37344168.wulf/gallery", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@worst_kitty_207/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "comic", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3924920, "client_id": 3932189, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bef54591/uploads/origins/6ca31c5b-05bc-42b6-8a89-8ccd0532817e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e302280e0a080f72af316b769d7dbb95", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bef54591/uploads/origins/6ca31c5b-05bc-42b6-8a89-8ccd0532817e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e302280e0a080f72af